<Base title="About Ilian Aigner — Hamburg, Delaware & Three Languages" description="Get to know Ilian Aigner: from Hamburg to Delaware, speaking German, English, and French, with a perspective shaped by basketball and travel." kind="about">
  <header class="about-hero shell">
    <div class="about-hero-copy"><p class="section-label">About / Ilian Aigner</p><h1>From Hamburg.<br />Still exploring.</h1><p>Hamburg is home; Delaware is where I study and build. I speak German, English, and French. Moving between places and languages has shaped how I connect with people.</p><div class="about-hero-links"><a href="#languages">The languages <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a href="/work/">What I do <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
    <figure class="about-hero-photo"><img src="/assets/images/ilian-portrait-shirt-700.jpg" width="700" height="700" alt="Portrait of Ilian Aigner in a navy suit" fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>Hamburg <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> Delaware</figcaption></figure>
  </header>
  <section class="about-culture shell" id="languages" aria-labelledby="languages-heading">
    <div><p class="section-label">Across languages</p><h2 id="languages-heading">Understand the person.<br />Then find the words.</h2></div>
    <div class="about-culture-copy"><p>Speaking three languages has made me careful about assumptions. What lands in one conversation may miss in another. I try to listen closely and explain things in a way that makes sense to the person in front of me.</p><ul aria-label="Languages I speak"><li>German</li><li>English</li><li>French</li></ul></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-personal shell" aria-labelledby="outside-heading"><div class="about-personal-pause"><div><p class="section-label">Outside work</p><h2 id="outside-heading">Basketball stays.<br />The scenery changes.</h2></div><div class="about-personal-copy"><p>Basketball is familiar ground for me in Hamburg. Travel puts me somewhere new and makes me pay attention. Both keep me curious about people and places beyond my own routine.</p></div></div><div class="about-photo-diptych" aria-label="Travel and life outside work"><figure><img src="/assets/images/japan-pagoda.jpg" width="1179" height="2091" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Red pagoda among trees beneath a bright sky in Japan" /><figcaption>Travel / Japan</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/assets/images/snowboarding.jpg" width="1179" height="2082" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Snowboarder in a red jacket on a snowy mountain" /><figcaption>Outside the routine / Snowboarding</figcaption></figure></div></section>
</Base>
